// Package db is the data layer's one door to PostgreSQL.
//
// db.go, models.go, query.sql.go and orders_export.sql.go are generated by
// sqlc from migrations/ and the query files: do not edit them. The other
// non-test files, tx.go (Rollback), pgerror.go (ConstraintName, IsConstraint,
// WrapRefusal) and like.go (EscapeLike), are hand-written helpers around pgx
// that every store uses; sqlc regeneration leaves them alone.
package db
